ios/Local.xcconfig
# Generated by `cd ios && xcodegen` from project.yml. CI regenerates this on every build and
# never reads the checked-in copy, so tracking it only lets it go stale (new source files
# silently missing from the project until someone reruns xcodegen) and adds noisy,
# conflict-prone pbxproj diffs to every PR that adds/renames/removes a file.
ios/Where.xcodeproj/
cli/where_cli_state.json
*.swp
*.txt
!android/fastlane/play_metadata/**/*.txt
!android/src/main/play/**/*.txt
!android/src/fdroid/play/**/*.txt
!ios/fastlane/metadata/**/*.txt
.log
